From: IrfanMohammad <irfan@graphiant.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Oct 2023 14:56:54 +0000
Subject: enable atomic readers list

1. merge the readers count and readers cid arrays into one 64bit atomic
   array. the upper 32 bits hold the cid, and the lower 32 bits hold the
   count.
2. Use an atomic read_count to keep track of how many readers exist.
---
